{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_113_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_113","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，晉人、衞人、陳人、鄭人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_113_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_113","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，癸亥，葬我小君聲姜。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_113_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_113","textTraditional":"三、齊侯伐我西鄙。六月，癸未，公及齊侯盟於穀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_113_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_113","textTraditional":"四、諸侯會於扈。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_113_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_113","textTraditional":"五、秋，公至自穀。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_113_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_113","textTraditional":"六、冬，公子遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}